 Airport Transfer','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578683010236-d716f9a3f461?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&hotel_id=99','+1 4082296820','2026-07-21 17:33:44'),(100,'Dubai Paradise Cove Beach Resort',39,5,23710.00,'Free WiFi, Swimming Pool, Spa & Wellness, Restaurant, Air Conditioning, Airport Transfer','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591088398332-8a7791972843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&hotel_id=100','+1 4038468543','2026-07-21 17:33:45'),(101,'Dubai Grand Heritage Resort & Spa',39,5,34075.00,'Free WiFi, Swimming Pool, Spa & Wellness, Restaurant, Air Conditioning, Airport Transfer','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611892440504-42a792e24d32?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&hotel_id=101','+1 4024954461','2026-07-21 17:33:45'),(105,'Coorg The Royal Horizon Resort',41,5,10421.00,'Free WiFi, Swimming Pool, Spa & Wellness, Restaurant, Air Conditioning, Airport Transfer','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&hotel_id=105','+91 9829929631','2026-07-21 17:33:45');
