umtaz Mahal.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605649487212-47bdab064df7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=96',1.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(97,24,'Agra Fort Red Sandstone Citadel','Historical fortress residence of the Mughal Dynasty emperors featuring royal palaces and gardens.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537996194471-e657df975ab4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=97',2.80,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(98,24,'Mehtab Bagh Sunset View Point','Charbagh garden complex located opposite the Taj Mahal across the Yamuna River.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518548419970-58e3b4079ab2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=98',6.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(99,25,'Dashashwamedh Ghat & Evening Aarti','The main ghat on the Ganges River famous for grand evening Ganga Aarti rituals with oil lamps and chants.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512100356356-de1b84283e18?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=99',0.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(100,25,'Kashi Vishwanath Temple','One of the most sacred Hindu temples dedicated to Lord Shiva, featuring a gold-plated spire.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509024644558-2f56ce76c490?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=100',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(101,25,'Sarnath Buddhist Stupa Site','Sacred deer park where Lord Buddha gave his first sermon after attaining enlightenment.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=101',10.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(102,26,'Golden Temple (Harmandir Sahib)','The holiest shrine of Sikhism gilded in gold, surrounded by the Amrit Sarovar holy water tank.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507699622108-4be3abd695ad?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=102',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(103,26,'Wagah Border Beating Retreat Ceremony','Electrifying military ceremony held daily at sunset by Indian BSF and Pakistani Rangers.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493976040374-85c8e12f0c0e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=103',28.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(104,26,'Jallianwala Bagh Memorial Garden','Historic public garden memorializing victims of the 1919 massacre, preserving original bullet walls.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514282401047-d79a71a590e8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=104',0.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(105,27,'City Palace Udaipur','Grand palace complex on Lake Pichola featuring intricate balconies, cupolas, and museum galleries.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552832230-c0197dd311b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=105',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(106,27,'Lake Pichola Boat Ride & Jagmandir','Picturesque lake cruise passing by Taj Lake Palace and stopping at Jagmandir Island Palace.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530122037265-a5f1f91d3b99?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=106',1.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(107,27,'Saheliyon-ki-Bari Royal Gardens','Historical garden of maidens with marble fountains, lotus pools, and elephant statues.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533105079780-92b9be482077?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=107',4.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(108,28,'Mysore Palace (Amba Vilas)','Indo-Saracenic royal palace illuminated by 100,000 light bulbs on weekends and Dasara festival.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503614472-8c93d56e92ce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=108',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(109,28,'Chamundi Hill & Chamundeshwari Temple','Hilltop temple dedicated to Goddess Chamundeshwari with a monolithic Nandi bull statue.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597074866923-dc0589150358?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=109',12.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(110,28,'Brindavan Gardens & Musical Fountains','Terraced gardens laid out below Krishnarajasagara Dam featuring synchronized musical fountain shows.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512343879784-a960bf40e7f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=110',19.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(111,29,'Ranthambore Fort Ruins','10th-century UNESCO World Heritage fort crowning a hill inside the tiger reserve.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546853020-ca4909aef454?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=111',5.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(112,29,'Padam Talao & Jogi Mahal','Largest lake in Ranthambore Park where wild tigers frequently come to drink and hunt.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590050752117-238cb0fb12b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=112',8.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(113,29,'Trinetra Ganesha Temple','Ancient three-eyed Ganesha temple situated inside Ranthambore Fort.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599661046289-e31897846e41?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=113',5.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(114,30,'Dhikala Tiger Zone Safari','Premier safari zone inside Jim Corbett National Park offering overnight stays and tiger sightings.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=114',14.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(115,30,'Garjiya Devi River Temple','Sacred temple perched on a large rock in the middle of the Kosi River.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609949907687-34c82c23f2f0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=115',12.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(116,30,'Corbett Waterfall','Picturesque 20m waterfall surrounded by dense teak forest and natural birdlife.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615836245337-f5b9b2303f10?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=116',25.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(117,31,'Central Range Elephant Safari','Early morning elephant back safari providing close encounters with Indian one-horned rhinos.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600100395164-88484a0d9b4b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=117',3.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(118,31,'Kaziranga National Orchid & Biodiversity Park','Vast park displaying over 500 species of wild orchids, native plants, and Assam cultural dances.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581793745862-99fde7fa73d2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=118',2.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:36'),(119,31,'Kakochang Waterfalls','Secluded waterfall amidst tea gardens and rubber plantations near Kaziranga.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570168007204-dfb528c6958f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=119',13.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(120,32,'Laxman Jhula & Ram Jhula Suspended Bridges','Famous iron suspension bridges across the holy Ganges River connecting ashrams and markets.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512453979798-5ea266f8880c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=120',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(121,32,'Triveni Ghat Evening Ganga Aarti','Sacred bathing ghat where lamps are floated on the Ganges river amid devotional music.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502602898657-3e91760cbb34?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=121',3.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(122,32,'Beatles Ashram (Chaurasi Kutia)','Historical ashram where The Beatles stayed in 1968, featuring graffiti art galleries and meditation domes.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511739001486-6bfe10ce785f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=122',4.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(123,33,'Pangong Tso High Altitude Lake','Surreal 134km long saltwater lake changing colors from blue to green at 14,270 ft.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565099824688-e93eb20fe622?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=123',160.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(124,33,'Nubra Valley & Hunder Sand Dunes','High altitude desert valley featuring double-humped Bactrian camel rides and Diskit Monastery.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509439581779-6298f75bf6e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=124',125.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(125,33,'Khardung La Pass','World-famous motorable mountain pass at 17,582 ft connecting Leh to Nubra Valley.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626621341517-bbf3d9990a23?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=125',39.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(126,34,'Key Monastery (Ki Gompa)','1,000-year-old Tibetan Buddhist monastery perched on a conical hill at 13,668 ft.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605649487212-47bdab064df7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=126',12.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(127,34,'Chandratal Moon Lake','Crescent-shaped high altitude lake situated at 14,100 ft amidst snow-capped peaks.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537996194471-e657df975ab4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=127',45.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(128,34,'Hikkim Highest Post Office','The world’s highest post office at 14,567 ft where travelers send postcards worldwide.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518548419970-58e3b4079ab2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=128',15.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(129,35,'Gateway of India & Taj Mahal Palace','26m arch monument overlooking Mumbai Harbour, opposite the iconic 1903 heritage hotel.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512100356356-de1b84283e18?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=129',1.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(130,35,'Marine Drive Queens Necklace','3.6km long C-shaped boulevard along the coast famous for evening sea breeze and skyline lights.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509024644558-2f56ce76c490?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=130',3.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(131,35,'Elephanta Island Cave Temples','UNESCO World Heritage rock-cut cave temples dedicated to Lord Shiva, accessible by ferry.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=131',10.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(132,36,'Qutub Minar Complex','73m UNESCO red sandstone minaret built in 1192 surrounded by ancient ruins and the Iron Pillar.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507699622108-4be3abd695ad?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=132',12.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(133,36,'India Gate & Kartavya Path','42m war memorial arch surrounded by lush lawns, fountains, and national monuments.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493976040374-85c8e12f0c0e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=133',2.50,'2026-07-21 17:22:37'),(134,36,'Humayun’s Tomb Garden Mausoleum','Red sandstone Mughal garden tomb built in 1570 that inspired the architecture of the Taj Mahal.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514282401047-d79a71a590e8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80&attraction_id=134',5.00,'2026-07-21 17:22:37');
